-034","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-034-yanghu-ws2567662-rendered-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p003","text":"帝之討諸葛誕也，秀與尚書僕射陳泰、黃門侍郎鍾會以行台從，豫參謀略。及誕平，轉尚書，進封魯陽鄉侯，增邑千戶。常道鄉公立，以豫議定策，進爵縣侯，增邑七百戶，遷尚書僕射。魏咸熙初，厘革憲司。時荀顗定禮儀，賈充正法律，而秀改官制焉。秀議五等之爵，自騎督已上六百餘人皆封。於是秀封濟川侯，地方六十里，邑千四百戶，以高苑縣濟川墟為侯國。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p003:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"承上文文帝，討諸葛誕的主將司馬昭；未至後段武帝受禪。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p003:m0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"諸葛誕","kind":"person","person_id":"655_392_7f8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p003:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"秀","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p003:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"陳泰","kind":"person","person_id":"9w8_tqh_ysn_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p003:m0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"鍾會","kind":"person","person_id":"a6a_4c2_670","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p003:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"誕","kind":"person","person_id":"655_392_7f8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p003:m0053","start":53,"end":57,"surface":"常道鄉公","kind":"person","person_id":"4m1_lym_noz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei: