"surface":"傅嘏","kind":"person","person_id":"653_8ef_1fd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p001:m0154","start":154,"end":157,"surface":"甯武子","kind":"person","person_id":"jsi_q8y_rdj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p001:m0175","start":175,"end":178,"surface":"陳留王","kind":"person","person_id":"4m1_lym_noz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p001:m0208","start":208,"end":209,"surface":"瓘","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison"},{"id":"c-jinshu-040-wyd1739-jiachong:p003","text":"充雅長法理有平反之稱轉中護軍高貴鄉公之攻相府也充率衆距戰於南闕軍將敗騎督成倅弟太子舍人濟謂充曰今日之事何如充曰公等養汝正擬今日復何疑濟於是抽戈犯蹕及常道鄉公即位進封安陽鄉侯增邑千二百戶統城外諸軍加散騎常侍鍾會謀反於蜀帝假充節以本官都督關中隴右諸軍事西據漢中未至而會死時軍國多事朝廷機密皆與籌之帝甚信重充與裴秀王沈羊祜荀勗同受腹心之任帝又命充定法律假金章賜甲第一區五等初建封臨沂侯為晉元勲深見寵異祿賜常優於羣官充有刀筆才能","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-040-wyd1739-jiachong:p003:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"充","kind":"person","person_id":"jmv_vc4_gep_*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-040-wyd1739-jiachong:p003:m0014","start":14,"end":18,"surface":"高貴鄉公","kind":"person","person_id":"d6b_ea7_928","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-040-wyd1739-jiachong:p003:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"充","kind":"person","person_id":"jmv_vc4_gep_*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-040-wyd1739-jiachong:p003:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"成倅","kind":"person","person_id":"cb4_3d3_964","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-040-wyd1739-jiachong:p003:m0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"濟","kind":"person","person_id":"g31_yju_684","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-040-wyd1739-jiachong:p003:m0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"充","kind":"person","person_id":"jmv_v